<title>SPAIN: Spain to push terrestrial digital television.</title>
<headline>Spain to push terrestrial digital television.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Development Minister Rafael Arias Salgado said on Wednesday that Spain would push terrestrial digital television.</p>
<p>&quot;The commitment of the government is firm. We will launch terrestrial digital television,&quot; Salgado told a conference.</p>
<p>Spain has promoted digital television by satellite, backing a platform for this. It has very little cable infrastructure, which makes the terrestrial coverage more attractive.</p>
<p>Terrestrial coverage uses radio transmissions.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
